  there's very little question that that  actually happened and now that this  monster is finally being brought to  justice at least in a small way at this  point he's still walking around but  eventually he's gonna have the same kind  of treatment that Bill Cosby got  hopefully far worse because Weinstein  did it to more women that we know of  than Cosby did so the people in New York  have a choice at this point I mean they  still have some time before the primary  and hopefully this story gains some  traction  hopefully Cuomo has to come out and  explain why he took the money and then  immediately killed this investigation  and why he suddenly felt that that money  overruled what all of these women were  claiming happened to them at the hands  of Harvey Weinstein and the Weinstein  group we're living at a time right now  where sexual assaulters people who prey  upon women and try to use them or you  know manipulate them for any reason  whatsoever they're finally facing some  kind of justice most of it at this point  is public justice shaming them you know  having them lose their jobs  destroying careers and these are things  that should be happening to these men to  anyone who behaves in this manner and  preys upon other human beings that  should happen what's also happening and  this is why what Cuomo did here is  equally disgusting is lawsuits are being  filed not just against the people who  did the things but to the people who  helped cover it up the Weinstein group  is being sued I believe Disney is  actually even a part of that because  they worked with him and they knew about  the behavior you have colleges and  universities across this country that  are being sued  because they knew they had somebody  employed at their university that was  abusing students in a sexual way and the  university helped cover it up Jim Jordan  is actually named in the lawsuit for OSU  because he knew about it allegedly and  did nothing so he's been named in that  civil lawsuit 